      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.64 (up from ₹4.50 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹7.33b (up 11% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹480.4m (up 3.1% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.6% (down from 7.1% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 22% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Chemicals industry in India.",
